            "paragraph": "To reduce the impact of errors in the level ice fraction, we applied different melt pond parameterizations depending on region. The level melt pond scheme was used in the Barents Sea, Beaufort Sea, and Central Arctic, where it is assumed to improve albedo representation and produced realistic seasonal melt evolution in our simulations based on past literature (Hunke et al., 2013).",
