            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "However, in the Coastal Canada and Siberian-Chukchi Seas, the level scheme led to albedo evolution that significantly diverged from observational constraints. In these two regions, we therefore applied the empirical topographic melt pond scheme, which has been used in several Coupled Model Intercomparison Project Phase 6 (CMIP6) models (Keen et al., 2021) and yielded better agreement with observed albedo variability.",
